<title>USA: Redbook sales said up 2.3 pct w/e June 7 - source.</title>
<headline>Redbook sales said up 2.3 pct w/e June 7 - source.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Redbook Retail Sales Index was expected to show a rise of 2.3 percent in the period ending June 7, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Lynch, Jones &amp; Ryan Inc will report the Redbook Index later on Tuesday at 1455 EDT/1855 GMT.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
